          "post_id": "70049",
          "text": "<p>Ashish was astouned to hear that his sister, whom he knew to be quite _______, was described as&nbsp;taciturn and aloof by her&nbsp;colleagues at the University.</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>insular</li>\n    <li>placid</li>\n    <li>vacuous</li>\n    <li>garrulous</li>\n</ol>",
