          "post_id": "70056",
          "text": "<p>Scalpel: Surgeon :: &nbsp;?</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\">\n    <li>razor: barber</li>\n    <li>weed:gardner</li>\n    <li>recipe:chef</li>\n    <li>compass : engineer</li>\n</ol>",
