        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "70060",
          "text": "<ul>\n    <li>&nbsp;Dormitories range from two to six storeys in height.</li>\n    <li>If a dormitory room is above the second floor, it has a fire escape.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>If the statements above are true, which of the following must also be true?</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>2nd floor dormitory rooms do not have fire escapes</li>\n    <li>4th floor dormitory rooms &nbsp;have fire escapes</li>\n    <li>only dormitory rooms above the &nbsp;2nd floor have fire escapes</li>\n    <li>some 2-storey dormitories do not have fire escapes.&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
