        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "70068",
          "text": "<p>It is important to teach students to use computers effectively. Therefore students should be taught computer programming in&nbsp;school.</p>\n\n<p>Which of the following, if true, most weakens the argument above:</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>Only people who use computers effectively are skilled at computer programming</li>\n    <li>Most people who are able to program computers use computers effectively</li>\n    <li>Some schools teach computer programming more effectively than others</li>\n    <li>Some people who use computers effectively can not write computer programs</li>\n</ol>",
          "type": "Multiple Choice",
          "answer": "d",
          "award": 1,
          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "tags": "go-general-aptitude-1,verbal-aptitude,verbal-reasoning",
          "category": "Verbal Aptitude"
        },
        {
