          "post_id": "70071",
          "text": "<p>Raquet : Tennis ::</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>springboard:diver</li>\n    <li>glove:boxing</li>\n    <li>club:golf</li>\n    <li>gun:hunting</li>\n</ol>",
