          "text": "<p>Find out the wrong number in this sequence:</p>\n\n<p>105, 85, 60, 30, 0,-45, -90</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>0</li>\n    <li>85</li>\n    <li>-45</li>\n    <li>60</li>\n</ol>",
