        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "70083",
          "text": "<p>Because most of them lack recreational facilities, high rise apartments have been criticized in recent years as ____ for families with children . &nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\">\n    <li>unsuitable</li>\n    <li>degrading</li>\n    <li>inevitable</li>\n    <li>appropriate</li>\n</ol>",
