          "penalty": "0.3333",
          "tags": "go-general-aptitude-1",
          "category": "Quantitative Aptitude"
        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "70102",
          "text": "<p>According to Burgess, a novelist should not _____, &nbsp;for sermonizing has no place in good fiction.</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>invent</li>\n    <li>offend</li>\n    <li>inform</li>\n    <li>preach</li>\n</ol>",
