          "text": "<p>Sentence completion:<br>\nThe ______ modernist architecture _____ the natural human desire to celebrate the decorate to take delight in ornament. &nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>severity ... opposes</li>\n    <li>austerity ..... recognize</li>\n    <li>uniformity.... reflects</li>\n    <li>elaborateness ... neglects&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
