        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "70247",
          "text": "<p>Even as the ____ elsewhere in the world are struggling to come out of recession, Indian consumers are splurging on consumer goods and to ____ this growth, companies are investing heavily on various sectors.</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:upper-alpha\">\n    <li>economies .... &nbsp;meet</li>\n    <li>countries ..... inhibit</li>\n    <li>goverments .... measure</li>\n    <li>nations ...... inflict</li>\n</ol>",
